-width:fit-content;">December 31, 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, the Company's largest deposit relationship was </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_9451bae0-9d7b-4057-ad9c-b4fc6066a94d" contextRef="C_1900112a-7966-4536-8694-1c6db1e11842" name="us-gaap:PercentageOfInterestBearingDomesticDepositsToDeposits" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5.05</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of total deposits. No other deposit relationships exceeded </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_42af257a-cee1-49ac-b7c6-1d056110cc6a" contextRef="C_1900112a-7966-4536-8694-1c6db1e11842" name="us-gaap:PercentageOfInterestBearingDomesticDepositsToDepositsOtherTimeDeposit" unitRef="U_pure" scale="-2" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">% of total deposits.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
