nd deferred portions for the period indicated is as follows:</span></p><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_7dbc811e-7512-451e-b8fd-1bddf109b638" contextRef="C_5d56aa0d-11c4-4c3f-9c14-a792660af13c" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfComponentsOfIncomeTaxExpenseBenefitTableTextBlock" escape="true">
