  <div style="padding-top:0.5in;z-index:2;min-height:0.5in;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Arial;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><div><ix:continuation id="F_d337533c-2016-46c3-9d9a-e6669a100a0a_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Restricted Stock</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-style:italic;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Awards and Units</span></p><p style="text-indent:3.333%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Under the Plan, restricted stock awards ("RSAs") with a </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_d98232e2-c757-4e89-a55d-b58cafb556a2" contextRef="C_79823ae4-3d44-4a3e-909a-05bae7051144" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_bba5ffa1-d843-43fd-828d-5aac2eac86a1" contextRef="C_ef411e0f-60f6-4872-9306-d2aaf4b69487" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">one-year</span></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> vesting period were granted to non-employee directors as part of the </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">2024 and 2025</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> semi-annual retainer.  In February 2025, the Company awarded </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_32277285-284a-4ef3-968b-6dec7462e6f7" contextRef="C_ae94aa89-1628-4b21-9a7e-805af6652499" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" unitRef="U_shares" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">4,545</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> shares of restricted stock units ("RSUs") with a </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_a854c95d-c48c-4cff-a0f2-2061f10578b8" contextRef="C_ae94aa89-1628-4b21-9a7e-805af6652499" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">three year</span></ix:nonNumeric></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> vesting period to employees designated in the incentive compensation plan. The RSAs and RSUs were valued at the closing stock price on the grant date. </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:nonNumeric id="F_864d3edc-5cd3-4f2f-a473-030e7e2dad6a" contextRef="C_5d56aa0d-11c4-4c3f-9c14-a792660af13c" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfNonvestedShareActivityTableTextBlock" escape="true" continuedAt="F_864d3edc-5cd3-4f2f-a473-030e7e2dad6a_1"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">A summary of changes in the Company&#8217;s nonvested RSAs and RSUs under the Plan for the year ended </span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">December 31, 2025 follows:</span></ix:nonNumeric></span></p><div style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;"><ix:continuation id="F_864d3edc-5cd3-4f2f-a473-030e7e2dad6a_1"><p style="font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
